        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146783,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nós sabemos como repetir código usando um loop while. Como este programa de jogo que repete instruções para desenhar um HUD simples.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter1 = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter1 &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;HP: |||||  SCORE: -----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter1++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter2 = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter2 &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;HP: -----  SCORE: -----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter2++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146784,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usando <strong>for loops</strong>, podemos reescrever o mesmo programa de jogo tornando-o mais fácil de entender para outros programadores.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;HP: |||||  SCORE: -----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;HP: -----  SCORE: -----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146785,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para criar um loop <code>for</code>, começamos com a palavra-chave <code>for</code>, parênteses <code>( )</code> e chaves <code>{ }</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" () {}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>for</code> seguido de <code>()</code> e depois <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146786,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um loop for nos permite criar a variável de contagem dentro dos parênteses, como <code>let frame = 1;</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"19\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" frame = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";) {}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>let frame = 1;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146787,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um nome comum para uma variável contador é a letra <code>i</code>, que significa índice. Vamos usá-la para aprender sobre loops <code>for</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"frame\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";) {}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146788,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Após o ponto e vírgula, colocamos uma condição como <code>i &lt; 5</code> e adicionamos outro ponto e vírgula <code>;</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i = 10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";) {}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>i &lt; 5</code> seguido de <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146789,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por último, incrementamos a variável contador com <code>i++</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"26\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>i++</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146790,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O código de um loop for é mais fácil de ler porque a informação sobre quantas vezes o loop se repete está dentro dos parênteses.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tick &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>(</code> seguido de <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146791,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Que tipo de loop isso tem?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn enemy #&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Um loop for</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Um loop while</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Um loop for.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146792,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Onde vai a variável contador de um loop for?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dentro dos parênteses <code>( )</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dentro das chaves <code>{ }</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dentro dos parênteses <code>( )</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 146793,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual variável é a variável contadora do loop for?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power up!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss incoming!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>counter</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 146794,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual condição o loop for possui?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Start level&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Collect coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i &lt; 3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let i = 0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>i &lt; 3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 146795,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com este código?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy id: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" i++\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i++</code> está fora dos parênteses <code>( )</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não há nada de errado com o código</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>i++</code> está fora dos parênteses <code>( )</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 146796,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que o código de um loop for é mais fácil de ler do que o código de um loop while?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;HP: |||||  SCORE: -----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;HP: -----  SCORE: -----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Porque o número de vezes que o loop for se repete está em um só lugar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Porque o loop for nos impede de escrever loops infinitos</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Porque o número de vezes que o loop for se repete está em um só lugar.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 146797,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Monte a estrutura de um loop for.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" () {}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>for</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e depois <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 146798,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dentro dos parênteses, crie a variável contador com <code>let i = 5;</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"15\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn point &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>let i = 5;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 146799,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dentro do loop for, use a variável contador <code>i</code> para exibir <code>\"Wave \" + i</code> no console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Wave &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"Wave \"</code> seguido de <code>+</code> e finalmente <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>"
